Reactor (static)

Nuclear reactor components.

Properties:
  RTGs                        - List of RTG devices
  ControlRods                 - List of control rods
  Pumps                       - List of coolant pumps
  FuelRods                    - List of fuel rods

Nested Classes:
  Motor       - Motor with speed/torque control
  RTG         - Radioisotope thermoelectric generator
  ControlRod  - Reactor control rod
  Pump        - Coolant pump
  FuelRod     - Nuclear fuel rod

Interface: ITemperature
  Temperature                 - Current temperature
  NeutronFlux                 - Neutron radiation level
  AlphaFlux                   - Alpha radiation level
  BetaFlux                    - Beta radiation level
  GammaFlux                   - Gamma radiation level

Motor:
  Speed                       - Motor speed (settable)
  Torque                      - Current torque output
  BackEMF                     - Back electromotive force
  MaxSpeed                    - Maximum speed limit

ControlRod:
  Position                    - Rod insertion depth (settable)
  Motor                       - Associated motor

Pump:
  FlowRate                    - Current flow rate
  Motor                       - Associated motor

FuelRod:
  FuelType                    - Type of fuel
